|newversion= English translation from
|year2= 1977|origlang2= ru|title2= What the “Friends of the People” Are and How They Fight the Social-Democrats|chapter2= Part I|series2= V. I. Lenin – Collected Works|seriesvolume2= 1
|page2= 154|pageurl2= https://archive.org/details/LeninCW/Lenin%20CW-Vol.%201/page/n163/mode/2up
|origtext= ru:Нет ничего характернее для '''буржуа''', как перенесение черт современных порядков на все времена и народы.
|text= Nothing is more characteristic of the '''bourgeois''' than the application of the features of the modern system to all times and peoples.}}

