The path from Proto-Germanic to Old French is unclear. Perhaps via {{der|fr|frk|*burg}} or {{der|fr|LL.|burgus}}, or possibly both, and probably through the {{der|fr|LL.|-}} intermediate {{m|la|burgensis}}. Compare {{cog|it|borghese}}, {{cog|pt|burguês}}, {{cog|es|burgués}}.

